; expect 42
; A function used as a value: the bare reference builds a one-word
; closure record holding the code pointer - the representation stage0
; gives a captureless top-level function - and a call whose head is a
; parameter goes indirect through word 0. Saturated application.
(:: inc (-> Int Int))
(fn (inc x) (+ x 1))
(:: apply (-> (-> Int Int) Int Int))
(fn (apply f x) (f x))
(:: main Int)
(fn (main) (apply inc 41))
